Error [jet.FormActionInputMismatch]: Form action `submit` does not accept `Checkout`
  --> tests/ui/e2474_form_action_input_mismatch.jet:11:30
    |
 11 |     form: web.form(Checkout, action: submit)
    |                              ^^^^^^
 Why: The form derives its fields from the model and the one server-function action must receive that exact input type
 Fix: Change `submit` to accept `Checkout` as its only parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2474
